# Pertaining to a [[league]] or [[treaty]]; [[derive]]d from an [[agreement]] or [[covenant#Noun|covenant]] between [[party#Noun|parties]], especially between [[nation]]s.
#* {{RQ:Grew Cosmologia Sacra|chapter=Of Providence over Publick States|para=27|page=113|passage=Yet the ''Romans'', taking them [the Carthaginians] at an Advantage, vvhen they vvere in Streights; compell'd them, contrary to all '''Fœderal''' Right and Juſtice, by Nevv Articles, both to part with ''Sardinia'', their Lavvful Territory, and alſo to pay them for the future, a Double Tribute.}}
# Pertaining to the [[national#Adjective|national]] [[government]] [[level#Noun|level]] in a federal nation, as opposed to [[state]], [[provincial]], [[county]], [[city]], or [[town]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1798|author=[[w:James Madison|James Madison]]|title=[[w:Kentucky and Virginia Resolutions|Virginia Resolutions of 1798]]|url=https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Virginia_Resolutions_of_1798
|text=That this Assembly doth explicitly and peremptorily declare, that it views the powers of the '''federal''' government as resulting from the compact to which the states are parties, as limited by the plain sense and intention of the instrument constituting that compact, as no further valid than they are authorized by the grants enumerated in that compact; [...]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1996|author=[[w:United States House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform|United States House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform]]|title=Activities of '''Federal''' Law Enforcement Agencies Toward the Branch Davidians|url=https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Activities_of_Federal_Law_Enforcement_Agencies_Toward_the_Branch_Davidians
|text=From April 1995 to May 1996, the Subcommittee on Crime of the House Committee on the Judiciary and the Subcommittee on National Security, International Affairs, and Criminal Justice of the House Committee on Government Reform and Oversight jointly conducted an investigation into the actions of the '''Federal''' agencies involved in law enforcement activities near Waco, TX in late 1992 and early 1993 toward a group known as the Branch Davidians.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2021|author=[[w:Joe Biden|Joe Biden]]|title=[[w:Executive Order 13991|Executive Order 13991 (Protecting the Federal Workforce and Requiring Mask-Wearing)]]|section=Section 1 (Policy)|url=https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Executive_Order_on_Protecting_the_Federal_Workforce_and_Requiring_Mask-Wearing
|text=Accordingly, to protect the '''Federal''' workforce and individuals interacting with the '''Federal''' workforce, and to ensure the continuity of Government services and activities, on-duty or on-site '''Federal''' employees, on-site '''Federal''' contractors, and other individuals in '''Federal''' buildings and on '''Federal''' lands should all wear masks, maintain physical distance, and adhere to other public health measures, as provided in CDC guidelines.}}
# {{lb|en|theology}} Relating to [[covenantalism]].
#: {{ux|en|'''federal''' theology}}

